    {
      "subId": "4112406",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Vile",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411240601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411240601": {
            "id": "411240601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "Have you planted the letters?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411240602"
            ]
          },
          "411240602": {
            "id": "411240602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411240603"
            ]
          },
          "411240603": {
            "id": "411240603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "That will do. I trust that the Treasure Hunters will make their plans based on the intelligence contained within those letters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411240604"
            ]
          },
          "411240604": {
            "id": "411240604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "And that \"ideal moment\" should be somewhere between nightfall and dawn.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411240605"
            ]
          },
          "411240605": {
            "id": "411240605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "As for the \"ideal entry point...\" Well, there can only be one, yes? Come, I'll mark it out on your map.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411240606"
            ]
          },
          "411240606": {
            "id": "411240606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "Well, that should do it. All we need to do now is wait for those Treasure Hoarders to walk into our trap.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411240608",
              "411240611"
            ]
          },
          "411240608": {
            "id": "411240608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "Well, your concerns do have merit. Our unorthodox methods, if discovered by the Knights, could land us in hot water...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411240609"
            ]
          },
          "411240609": {
            "id": "411240609",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "But rest assured, that gentleman has guaranteed that no such trouble will occur. So let's just... have a little faith, shall we?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411240612"
            ]
          },
          "411240612": {
            "id": "411240612",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "So, all you need to do is to wait till nightfall, and defeat our entrapped Treasure Hoarders."
          },
          "411240611": {
            "id": "411240611",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Vile",
            "text": "Oh, they will, alright. Don't you worry about that. These plans were laid by that gentleman himself. Nothing will go wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
